 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.05,
   "text": "The next shot looks like the first one. Sam on the couch."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.1,
   "end": 10.55,
   "text": "The *mug* glowing faintly in the kitchen like a tiny, ceramic *guilt* trip."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.6,
   "end": 16.85,
   "text": "But this time, he knows what it is. An *open* *tab*, with a *plan* attached."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.9,
   "end": 21.15,
   "text": "The *guilt* wasn't proof that he was doing something wrong."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.2,
   "end": 27.95,
   "text": "It was just an old *alarm*, going off in a room where *nothing* was on fire."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.0,
   "end": 31.55,
   "text": "Sam picks up the remote. He presses *Play*."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.6,
   "end": 38.35,
   "text": "And you? What's your *mug* tonight? And what would happen if it just waited until morning?"
  }
 ]
}